about/index.html:347:<section class="hero"><div class="shell"><div class="hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy reveal"><div class="eyebrow">About</div><h1>We build better systems<br/>and stronger digital credibility.</h1><p>ProAI Expert is a studio at the intersection of AI Systems and Websites &amp; Branding. We help businesses build clearer operations, stronger digital foundations, and a more credible external presence.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn" href="/contact/#project-intake">Discuss Project</a><a class="ghost" href="#disciplines">View Disciplines</a></div></div><aside class="anchor-card panel reveal" style="--d:120ms;"><div class="anchor-inner"><div class="anchor-photo-wrap"><img alt="Ihor Horb" class="anchor-photo" src="../ru/about/ProAI_Founder_Portrait_2x3.webp"/></div><div><span class="anchor-kicker">Studio Anchor</span><h3>Ihor Horb</h3><div class="anchor-role">Founder, ProAI Expert</div><p>We eliminate digital noise. We build working systems for businesses that need structure, trust, and a stronger presence.</p></div></div></aside></div></div></section>
about/index.html:348:<section class="section" id="thesis"><div class="shell"><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.02fr) minmax(360px,.78fr);gap:84px;align-items:start"><div class="reveal" style="max-width:860px"><div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">Architecture of Clarity</div><h2>Studio logic, not digital noise.</h2></div><div style="display:grid;gap:0"><div style="padding-top:0;margin-top:0"><p style="font-size:clamp(28px,2.3vw,38px);line-height:1.16;letter-spacing:-1.2px;font-weight:760;max-width:760px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.96)">Businesses do not need more digital noise. They need a system that helps them operate with more confidence and show up with more credibility.</p></div><div style="padding-top:34px;margin-top:34px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)"><p style="font-size:clamp(22px,1.8vw,30px);line-height:1.28;letter-spacing:-.9px;font-weight:650;max-width:760px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.84)">AI without the right structure often stays invisible. Presentation without a real system quickly loses force and rarely holds up under growth.</p></div><div style="padding-top:34px;margin-top:34px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)"><p style="font-size:clamp(22px,1.8vw,30px);line-height:1.28;letter-spacing:-.9px;font-weight:650;max-width:760px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.72)">That is why AI Systems and Websites &amp; Branding are not two separate directions for us. They are two parts of the same business architecture.</p></div></div></div><div class="panel reveal" style="--d:140ms;min-height:560px;border-radius:34px;position:relative;overflow:hidden"><div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.03) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,.03) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:34px 34px;opacity:.13;mask-image:radial-gradient(circle at center,black,transparent 88%)"></div><div style="position:absolute;inset:46px 42px;border-radius:30px;border:1px solid rgba(207,230,247,.08)"></div><div style="position:absolute;top:58px;left:34px;border:1px solid rgba(207,230,247,.1);border-radius:24px;padding:22px;background:rgba(10,12,18,.52);max-width:272px"><strong style="display:block;color:#CFE6F7;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px">AI Systems</strong><span style="display:block;color:rgba(255,255,255,.66);line-height:1.68;font-size:15px">Operational clarity, control, and stronger internal business logic.</span></div><div style="position:absolute;top:202px;right:34px;border:1px solid rgba(207,230,247,.1);border-radius:24px;padding:22px;background:rgba(10,12,18,.52);max-width:272px"><strong style="display:block;color:#CFE6F7;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px">Presentation</strong><span style="display:block;color:rgba(255,255,255,.66);line-height:1.68;font-size:15px">Digital perception, trust, and outward credibility that reads at the right level.</span></div><div style="position:absolute;bottom:46px;left:104px;border:1px solid rgba(207,230,247,.1);border-radius:24px;padding:22px;background:rgba(10,12,18,.52);max-width:272px"><strong style="display:block;color:#CFE6F7;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px">Studio</strong><span style="display:block;color:rgba(255,255,255,.66);line-height:1.68;font-size:15px">One mature system where internal logic and external perception reinforce each other.</span></div></div></div></div></section>
about/index.html:349:<section class="section" id="anchor"><div class="shell"><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(300px,.62fr);gap:64px;align-items:start"><div class="reveal"><span style="display:inline-block;color:var(--cyan);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2.6px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:18px">Founder &amp; Studio Lead</span><h2 style="font-size:clamp(32px,3.5vw,58px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1.8px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:20px;max-width:760px">A strong digital system should not only be intelligent. It should be clear, composed, and commercially credible.</h2><p style="max-width:760px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.78;color:rgba(255,255,255,.68)">ProAI Expert is built on a practical view of AI, automation, business structure, and digital credibility. We see the studio as a place where technology, logic, and perception work together rather than compete for attention.</p><p style="max-width:760px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.78;color:rgba(255,255,255,.68);margin-top:16px">Our role is not simply to introduce tools. It is to help a business build a stronger way of operating — and a stronger way of being understood.</p></div><div class="panel reveal" style="--d:120ms;padding:30px 28px;border-radius:24px"><strong style="display:block;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:12px;color:var(--cyan);letter-spacing:2.2px;text-transform:uppercase">Studio Thesis</strong><p style="font-size:20px;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:-.45px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.88)">When internal structure and external credibility operate at the same standard, trust stops depending on chance and starts becoming the result of design.</p></div></div></div></section>
about/index.html:350:<section class="section" id="disciplines"><div class="shell"><div class="panel reveal" style="padding:42px 42px 46px;border-radius:34px"><div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">One Studio</div><h2>One studio. Two disciplines. One system.</h2></div><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:32px;margin-top:34px"><article class="panel" style="min-height:320px;padding:32px 30px;border-radius:28px"><h3 style="font-size:clamp(30px,3vw,46px);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-1.5px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:18px">AI Systems</h3><p style="max-width:460px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.68);line-height:1.78;font-size:17px">We design AI systems, automation, and digital processes that reduce chaos, lower manual load, improve control, and make internal operations easier to manage.</p></article><article class="panel" style="min-height:320px;padding:32px 30px;border-radius:28px"><h3 style="font-size:clamp(30px,3vw,46px);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-1.5px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:18px">Websites &amp; Branding</h3><p style="max-width:460px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.68);line-height:1.78;font-size:17px">We create websites and digital brand systems that make expertise easier to see, strengthen trust, improve perception, and help a business look as strong as it actually is.</p></article></div><div style="margin-top:28px;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);font-size:20px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(255,255,255,.78);max-width:880px">ProAI Expert connects internal clarity and outward authority into one more mature business system.</div></div></div></section>
about/index.html:351:<section class="section" id="standards"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head reveal"><div class="eyebrow">Working Standards</div><h2>How we work</h2></div><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)"><article style="padding:32px 28px 34px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06)"><div style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;color:var(--cyan);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2.4px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:14px">01</div><h3 style="font-size:26px;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.8px;margin-bottom:12px;font-weight:800;max-width:380px">Clarity over noise</h3><p style="max-width:520px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.66);line-height:1.76;font-size:16px">We remove the excess and strengthen what actually helps a business make decisions, operate more calmly, and present itself with more conviction.</p></article><article style="padding:32px 28px 34px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)"><div style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;color:var(--cyan);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2.4px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:14px">02</div><h3 style="font-size:26px;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.8px;margin-bottom:12px;font-weight:800;max-width:380px">System first, surface second</h3><p style="max-width:520px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.66);line-height:1.76;font-size:16px">Any strong presentation should stand on logic, structure, and real usefulness, not on a polished image alone.</p></article><article style="padding:32px 28px 34px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06)"><div style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;color:var(--cyan);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2.4px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:14px">03</div><h3 style="font-size:26px;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.8px;margin-bottom:12px;font-weight:800;max-width:380px">Premium restraint</h3><p style="max-width:520px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.66);line-height:1.76;font-size:16px">We do not overload solutions with effects, words, or visual noise. Stronger outcomes usually come from decisions that are precise and composed.</p></article><article style="padding:32px 28px 34px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)"><div style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;color:var(--cyan);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2.4px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:14px">04</div><h3 style="font-size:26px;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.8px;margin-bottom:12px;font-weight:800;max-width:380px">Practical implementation</h3><p style="max-width:520px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.66);line-height:1.76;font-size:16px">We care about systems that can be deployed, used, and developed in real work, not ideas for their own sake.</p></article><article style="padding:32px 28px 34px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06)"><div style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;color:var(--cyan);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2.4px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:14px">05</div><h3 style="font-size:26px;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.8px;margin-bottom:12px;font-weight:800;max-width:380px">Trust through structure</h3><p style="max-width:520px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.66);line-height:1.76;font-size:16px">When a business looks composed and works with consistency, trust grows more powerfully than any promise can create on its own.</p></article><article style="padding:32px 28px 34px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)"><div style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;color:var(--cyan);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2.4px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:14px">06</div><h3 style="font-size:26px;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.8px;margin-bottom:12px;font-weight:800;max-width:380px">Less, but stronger</h3><p style="max-width:520px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.66);line-height:1.76;font-size:16px">We prefer fewer elements, fewer decisions, and less chaos, but a sharper result and a stronger effect.</p></article></div></div></section>
about/index.html:352:<section class="section" id="proof"><div class="shell"><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.88fr) minmax(320px,.72fr);gap:54px;align-items:start"><div class="reveal"><div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">Quiet Proof</div><h2>Signals of the approach</h2></div><div class="panel" style="padding:26px 28px;border-radius:26px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);line-height:1.75;font-size:17px"><strong style="display:block;color:#fff;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase">Financial Stream LLC (Case Study)</strong><span style="display:block;color:rgba(255,255,255,.68)">A live service-business case where digital structure, a website, and system thinking came together in one practical implementation.</span></div><div class="panel" style="padding:26px 28px;border-radius:26px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);line-height:1.75;font-size:17px;margin-top:18px"><strong style="display:block;color:#fff;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase">ProAI Expert</strong><span style="display:block;color:rgba(255,255,255,.68)">The studio's own flagship project, where the system itself becomes a case in structure, presentation, and execution discipline.</span></div><div class="panel" style="padding:26px 28px;border-radius:26px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);line-height:1.75;font-size:17px;margin-top:18px"><strong style="display:block;color:#fff;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase">Baseline Standard</strong><span style="display:block;color:rgba(255,255,255,.68)">Bilingual practice, systems thinking, and a focus on real implementation are not extras here. They are part of the base operating standard.</span></div></div><div class="reveal" style="--d:120ms;padding:32px;border-left:1px solid rgba(155,215,255,.18);color:rgba(255,255,255,.78);font-size:20px;line-height:1.66">Trust here is built less through loud claims and more through how structure, presentation, technical discipline, and next-step quality reinforce one another.</div></div></div></section>
about/index.html:353:<section class="section" id="why"><div class="shell"><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.88fr) minmax(320px,.72fr);gap:54px;align-items:start"><div class="reveal" style="padding:32px;border-left:1px solid rgba(155,215,255,.18);color:rgba(255,255,255,.78);font-size:20px;line-height:1.66">Clients usually do not come here for just another website or just another tool. They come when the business needs a stronger digital level.</div><div class="reveal" style="--d:120ms"><div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">Why Clients Come Here</div><h2>When people come to us</h2></div><div class="panel" style="padding:26px 28px;border-radius:26px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);line-height:1.75;font-size:17px"><strong style="display:block;color:#fff;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase">01</strong>When the business has outgrown a random or fragmented digital presence and needs a more coherent digital standard.</div><div class="panel" style="padding:26px 28px;border-radius:26px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);line-height:1.75;font-size:17px;margin-top:18px"><strong style="display:block;color:#fff;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase">02</strong>When internal operations and external presentation need to work at the same level of quality.</div><div class="panel" style="padding:26px 28px;border-radius:26px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);line-height:1.75;font-size:17px;margin-top:18px"><strong style="display:block;color:#fff;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase">03</strong>When the business needs more than execution and wants stronger studio judgment.</div><div class="panel" style="padding:26px 28px;border-radius:26px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);line-height:1.75;font-size:17px;margin-top:18px"><strong style="display:block;color:#fff;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase">04</strong>When what matters is not the number of actions, but the clarity, structure, and quality of the next step.</div></div></div></div></section>
about/index.html:354:<section style="padding:36px 0 120px;display:flex;justify-content:center"><div class="shell"><div class="panel reveal" style="padding:44px 46px 50px;border-radius:34px"><h2 style="font-size:clamp(42px,5vw,76px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-3px;font-weight:900;margin-bottom:18px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbfdff 0%,#edf5ff 44%,rgba(155,215,255,.9) 120%);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent">If your business needs a better operating system and stronger digital credibility, start with a conversation.</h2><p style="max-width:760px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);line-height:1.78;font-size:18px;margin-bottom:28px">We can help bring internal logic and external perception into a stronger relationship — without noise, without filler, and without random decisions.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn" href="/ai-systems/">View Disciplines</a></div></div></div></section>
