ai-systems/index.html:1921:<div class="governance-card reveal"><b>Deployment Discipline</b><h3>Rollout stays deliberate.</h3><p>Systems are introduced in a way that protects day-to-day operations and avoids tool-first disruption.</p></div>
ai-systems/index.html:1922:<div class="governance-card reveal"><b>Boundaries</b><h3>Automation knows where it stops.</h3><p>Escalation paths and approval logic keep important decisions visible instead of hiding them behind false autonomy.</p></div>
ai-systems/index.html:1923:<div class="governance-card reveal"><b>Scalability</b><h3>Structure can expand responsibly.</h3><p>The system layer is built so new workflows, teams, and use cases can be added without recreating chaos.</p></div>
