insights/index.html:413:<div class="hero-copy reveal"><span class="hero-kicker">Insights</span><h1>Signal matters more than noise.</h1><p>We publish selectively because most content does not deserve attention. These pieces focus on AI systems, business automation, digital trust, and service business websites — but only where there is something worth clarifying, challenging, or making more precise. This is not a content feed. It is the studio’s editorial layer for higher-signal thinking.</p></div>
insights/index.html:414:<aside class="featured-signal reveal" style="--reveal-delay:120ms;"><div class="signal-meta"><span>6 min read</span><span>Strategic Review</span><span>AI Systems</span></div><div><h2 class="featured-title">Where Automation Delivers Its First Real ROI</h2><p class="featured-premise">The first ROI from automation usually appears sooner than expected. This piece maps the operational zones where the business regains control fastest.</p></div><a class="feature-action" href="/insights/where-automation-delivers-its-first-real-roi/">Open brief</a></aside>
