insights/how-much-does-a-business-website-cost-in-2026-a-strategic-budget-view/index.html:326:<h1 class="article-title">How Much Does a Business Website Cost in 2026? A Strategic Budget View</h1>
insights/how-much-does-a-business-website-cost-in-2026-a-strategic-budget-view/index.html:327:<p class="article-deck">Website pricing based on page count or visual complexity is no longer a useful model for serious service businesses. In practice, the budget depends on the depth of business logic the site must carry: positioning, trust, content, structure, technical integrity, and readiness for future growth.</p>
insights/how-much-does-a-business-website-cost-in-2026-a-strategic-budget-view/index.html:328:<div class="article-meta"><span>8 min read</span><span>Websites &amp; Branding</span><span>April 2026</span></div>
insights/how-much-does-a-business-website-cost-in-2026-a-strategic-budget-view/index.html:329:</div>
insights/how-much-does-a-business-website-cost-in-2026-a-strategic-budget-view/index.html:330:<aside>
insights/how-much-does-a-business-website-cost-in-2026-a-strategic-budget-view/index.html:331:<div class="article-panel"><span class="article-side-label">Contents</span><ol class="toc-list"><li><a href="#page-count">Page count is not a pricing model</a></li><li><a href="#positioning">Positioning and offer clarity change scope</a></li><li><a href="#content-proof">Content and proof layers affect real effort</a></li><li><a href="#technical-integrity">Technical integrity is part of the budget</a></li><li><a href="#multilingual-scope">Multilingual execution adds structural scope</a></li><li><a href="#cheap-first">Cheap first often becomes expensive later</a></li><li><a href="#growth-budgeting">Budgeting should follow business intent</a></li><li><a href="#conclusion">Conclusion</a></li></ol></div>
insights/how-much-does-a-business-website-cost-in-2026-a-strategic-budget-view/index.html:332:<div class="article-panel"><span class="article-side-label">Inside this article</span><ul><li>Why page count is a weak metric for pricing modern service websites.</li><li>What really drives budget: positioning, proof, content, structure, and technical scope.</li><li>Why budget-first website decisions often become more expensive later.</li></ul></div>
insights/how-much-does-a-business-website-cost-in-2026-a-strategic-budget-view/index.html:333:</aside>
insights/how-much-does-a-business-website-cost-in-2026-a-strategic-budget-view/index.html:334:</div>
